SUMMARY:My Life Helping Funny People Be Funnier: An Evening with Alan Zweib
 el
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Original SNL writer Alan Zweibel discusses his creative partner
 ships with Gilda Radner\, Billy Crystal\, Garry Shandling\, Larry David\, 
